    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a cozy puzzle game in which you search for the differences between two pictures. Restore 26 animated artworks in the public domain, such as &quot;A Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte&quot; and &quot;The Great Wave off Kanagawa.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/b426503e81c7d1bc831c996b34d5c073.poster.avif?t=1746449386\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/b426503e81c7d1bc831c996b34d5c073.webm?t=1746449386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/b426503e81c7d1bc831c996b34d5c073.mp4?t=1746449386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses copyright-free or public-domain artworks to create levels. There is currently one chapter in the game, with 26 levels, each with three difficulties. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/62344aa60c43708d9c77c6297c2fee79.poster.avif?t=1746449386\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/62344aa60c43708d9c77c6297c2fee79.webm?t=1746449386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/62344aa60c43708d9c77c6297c2fee79.mp4?t=1746449386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small game developed is our first indie game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We hope you can find peace and fun in this free find-the-difference game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Our New Game!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LauNewBee studio is developing a new Steam game &quot;Tongue of Doge&quot;. Please wishlist to support us! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorry that we don\u2019t have time to develop new levels for now. After making this game, we felt a great sense of accomplishment. Unfortunately, there was no income, so the team went to do other things. If players are interested, after the development and maintenance of &quot;The Tongue of Doge&quot; is over, perhaps a new chapter can be produced and sold as DLC.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a cozy puzzle game in which you search for the differences between two pictures. Restore 26 animated artworks in the public domain, such as &quot;A Sunday Afternoon on the Island of La Grande Jatte&quot; and &quot;The Great Wave off Kanagawa.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/b426503e81c7d1bc831c996b34d5c073.poster.avif?t=1746449386\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/b426503e81c7d1bc831c996b34d5c073.webm?t=1746449386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/b426503e81c7d1bc831c996b34d5c073.mp4?t=1746449386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses copyright-free or public-domain artworks to create levels. There is currently one chapter in the game, with 26 levels, each with three difficulties. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/62344aa60c43708d9c77c6297c2fee79.poster.avif?t=1746449386\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/62344aa60c43708d9c77c6297c2fee79.webm?t=1746449386\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2983630/extras/62344aa60c43708d9c77c6297c2fee79.mp4?t=1746449386\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a small game developed is our first indie game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > We hope you can find peace and fun in this free find-the-difference game. </p><